meshmark bundles
================

meshmark itself is MIT licensed; see LICENSE.

Bundles built by this tool contain a copy of three.js (MIT, Copyright (c)
2010-2025 three.js authors), taken from the installation the build was pointed
at. three.js is not redistributed in this repository.

The bundle directory that `meshmark build` writes is yours. It contains a
copy of whatever mesh you pointed it at, under whatever terms that mesh
carries -- meshmark makes no claim on it and does not check it.

docs/annotator.jpg shows a photogrammetry scan of an operating room, published
here with the permission of its owner. It is not part of this project and is
not covered by the MIT licence above; it is illustration only. The scene shipped
in examples/ is synthetic and is covered by the licence.
